Q1. Which statement about an interface is CORRECT?

A. An interface can be instantiated directly
B. An interface can contain only abstract methods
C. A class can implement multiple interfaces
D. An interface can extend only one interface

ANSWER: C
OUTPUT: A class can implement multiple interfaces.


──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

